	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士ガンダム MSイグルー 1年戦争秘録」の第2話に登場するセモベンテ隊が使用していた“61式戦車”がU.C.ハードグラフに登場。1/35スケールの車体を「MSイグルー2 重力戦線」とも連動する実在感を突き詰めた設定で、表面の滑り止め、溶接部の表現まで緻密に再現。履帯は組み立てやすく、車体の大きさを活かした動力化改造にも対応しやすい軟質樹脂製のベルト式。マルチカラーで再現された同スケールの連邦軍兵フィギュア3種類が付属。細やかなマーキングを再現する水転写デカール、細部再現用のエッチングパーツが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The \"Type 61 tank\" used by the Semovente Corps that appears in the second episode of \"Mobile Suit Gundam MS Igloo 1 War Secret\" appears in U.C. Hard Graph. The 1/35 Scale car body is also linked with \"MS Igloo 2 Gravity Front\" to give it a realistic feel, and the non-slip surface and welded parts are precisely reproduced. The track is a belt type made of soft resin that is easy to assemble and can be easily adapted to motorized modifications that take advantage of the vehicle's size. Three types of Federation soldier figures of the same scale reproduced in multicolor are included. Includes water transfer decals to reproduce detailed markings and photo-etched parts to reproduce details."
		]
	},
